&lt;h3&gt;


  Key Advantages of the Open-Based Approach:
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Zero-Signal Reliability&lt;/strong&gt;: When hiking in a remote ravine or dense forest canopy, cell towers disappear. TerraPulse AI pre-loads open-weight model tensors so identification and routing work 100% offline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Data Sovereignty&lt;/strong&gt;: Foragers and nature lovers often spot endangered species or private garden microclimates. Open local AI ensures location coordinates and photos stay strictly on the user's hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Model Swapping &amp;amp; Edge Fine-Tuning&lt;/strong&gt;: Open weights allow users to swap specialized models (e.g. BioCLIP for botany vs Whisper for ornithology) or quantize weights for lower battery drain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;




&lt;h2&gt;


  Prize Categories
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Main Theme&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;Touch Grass&lt;/strong&gt; — Built with open-weight models to get people off their screens and out into nature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Open-Source AI Track&lt;/strong&gt;: Powered entirely by open-weight models (&lt;code&gt;BioCLIP&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;SmolVLM&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;MobileNet&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Whisper&lt;/code&gt;) running locally on device.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
